              "name": "Section Subtitle",
              "fill": "#a3a7ba",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1500,
              "content": "Four presets share one token set; every screen in this document is built from the same variables and can be re-themed by switching the frame's mode. Midnight is the default; Paper is the light theme.",
