                  "name": "Spec Note",
                  "fill": "#a3a7ba",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1140,
                  "content": "Deep navy page, warm peach text, purple accent. 640px column, 1.6 line height (24px pitch), monospace. The title's # hangs in the left margin so the title lines up with the body. The header shows the file name (accent dot = unsaved) on the left and counts on the right; counts exclude ghosted text. Page edges fade over 48px (drawn here as stepped overlays).",
