                  "content": "When the document is taller than the window, a column of ticks appears in the right margin: one per paragraph, its width scaled to the paragraph's length. The caret's paragraph is accent, the title is muted, the rest use the rule color. Documents that fit the window show no map. Paragraph versions show as dots beside the version bar, one per version; the shown version is the larger accent dot.",
