              "fill": "#a3a7ba",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1500,
              "content": "One panel for every scope. The page dims to 35% (except the target paragraph) while the sidebar has focus, and previewing options with the arrow keys is a single undo step.",
