                  "fill": "#8b7cf6",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1140,
                  "content": "Word / Selection scope  ·  Ctrl+Shift+A (Ctrl+D) · vim ga · right-click · the version dots        In the list: ↑↓ or j k preview · Enter keep · Delete or dd remove · i / o type · Ctrl+Shift+G ask AI · Esc close",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
