                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "PD4ZV",
                  "name": "Spec Note",
                  "fill": "#a3a7ba",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1140,
                  "content": "The first row is the original text. The left column marks the shown option with an accent dot (· for the others), the same dot language as the paragraph version dots; AI-written options carry ✦ on the right. The page previews the highlighted option live. Nothing is created until you add a first option, so opening and closing the sidebar never leaves empty groups.",
