        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "QJKVM",
          "name": "Principles Row",
          "gap": 40,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "UbWq3",
              "name": "Card: Principles",
              "width": 740,
              "fill": "#151823",
              "cornerRadius": 16,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 28,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "t1lHL",
                  "name": "Card Title",
                  "fill": "#f2f3f8",
                  "content": "Principles",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pFFOx",
                  "name": "Item",
                  "fill": "#b9bdd0",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "•  Calm by default. The page is the interface; chrome fades while you type and edges fade into the background.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "M1E0Ar",
                  "name": "Item",
                  "fill": "#b9bdd0",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "•  Alternatives, not edits. Words, sentences and paragraphs can hold several versions; nothing is lost by trying another.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "o7XVJ",
                  "name": "Item",
                  "fill": "#b9bdd0",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "•  Everything is a preview first. The Lab's cuts, marks and fixes are faded text, tints or AI alternates, and each action is one undo step.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "lfHVS",
                  "name": "Item",
                  "fill": "#b9bdd0",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "•  The model never rewrites. It proposes exact passages or options; you choose.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "A6qAo",
                  "name": "Item",
                  "fill": "#b9bdd0",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "•  Keyboard first, vim optional. Every command has a Ctrl key, and every command has a vim Normal-mode equivalent.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "L1jaL",
                  "name": "Item",
                  "fill": "#b9bdd0",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "•  Plain files. Markdown on disk, with a JSON sidecar that keeps alternates, ghosts and overflow.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
