                  "content": "After 2 seconds of continuous typing the header and footer fade to nothing over 400 ms (ease-in), leaving only the page. Moving the mouse, or pausing for 2 seconds, brings them back in 200 ms (ease-out). Badges and toasts follow the same opacity; an open overlay keeps the chrome visible.",
